    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being lost though. it's like the connection was so deep that when they died, the part of me that actually lived died too. i'm just going through the motions. waking up, eating, breathing... but there's no soul in it. it's just a hollow existence. i feel like a ghost just haunting my own life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
