    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting the exhaustion take over\"... i don't know. it's just that everything feels so unfinished. we were supposed to have so much more. it feels so wrong to keep going when they're just... gone. like i'm supposed to be where they are. it's like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
